  "ingredients": [
    "3/4 cup coconut flour",
    "8 tablespoon unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "1 1/2 teaspoon chili powder",
    "2 1/2 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1/2 teaspoon cayenne pepper",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "1/2 cup stevia/erythritol blend (such as Swerve)",
    "1/2 cup coconut oil",
    "3 tablespoon butter (salted)",
    "4 large egg",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Add the coconut flour to a mixing bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cocoa powder, chili powder, cinnamon, cayenne pepper, salt, and sweetener (save just a little bit for later). Mix it all together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a microwave-safe container, add the coconut oil and butter inside. Place in the microwave for 10–15 seconds until melted.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the eggs and vanilla to the butter mixture and whisk until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the butter and egg mixture to the dry ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix well, allowing the liquid to completely soak into the dry ingredients. Knead the mixture together into a dough.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form the dough into cookies and place on a lightly greased or parchment lined baking sheet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 12–15 minutes. The cookies will be slightly soft when taken out. Let cool for a few minutes before eating. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies/#wprm-recipe-50529-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/low-carb-mexican-hot-chocolate-cookies-14.jpg"
    }
  ],
